        "story_heading": "Why EZENTI Series Exists",
        "story_text": "<p>Not every idea belongs in the Core Collection.</p><p>Some concepts require the freedom to exist on their own, without being defined by a season, a product category, or a collection.</p><p>EZENTI Series exists as a creative space where those ideas can take shape in whatever form they need.</p><p>Today, they take the form of Collector Editions.<br>Tomorrow, they may become something entirely different.</p>",
        "rules_heading": "The Rules",
        "perspective_heading": "Founder's Perspective",
        "perspective_text": "<p>Building EZENTI has involved countless conversations. Many began around the garments we wanted to create, but often ended somewhere entirely different - talking about identity, purpose, creativity, and the ideas that kept shaping the brand.</p><p>Eventually, we realized some of those ideas deserved a place of their own.</p><p>That's how EZENTI Series began.</p>",
        "archive_heading": "EZENTI'S Archive",
